<title>THAILAND: Sahaviriya Steel Q3 loss rises 182 pct.</title>
<headline>Sahaviriya Steel Q3 loss rises 182 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (In millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Three months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	loss	1.01     vs    loss	 0.36</p>
<p>    Net		 loss    515.4	vs    loss     182.9</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	loss	3.21     vs    profit     0.24</p>
<p>    Net		 loss  1,639.41     vs    profit   120.69</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Sahaviriya Steel Industries Plc, a steel rod and sheet producer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950-3</p>
</text>
